# TLS + WebSocket in two lines. Caddy fetches a Let's Encrypt certificate for HV_DOMAIN the
# first time the A record resolves here, renews it forever, and proxies the WebSocket Upgrade
# with no extra configuration. This is what makes getUserMedia work at all off localhost.
#
# No load balancer on purpose: GCP's ALB closes idle WebSockets at its 30 s backend timeout,
# AWS's ALB at 60 s idle plus a 3600 s hard lifetime. Caddy has neither surprise.
{$HV_DOMAIN} {
    reverse_proxy gateway:8100
}
